  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add onions and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add ginger and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add chicken and cook until browned on all sides, about 5-6 minutes.",
    "Add berbere spice mix, turmeric, salt, and black pepper. Cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add chicken broth, bouillon cubes, and chicken. Bring to a boil, then cover and simmer for 30-40 minutes, or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Stir in cilantro and lemon juice. Taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired."
